sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS edge
    participant Auth as agent-auth Middleware<br/>(opt-in)
    participant Agent as Agent Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant LLM as LLM Inference<br/>(OGX/vLLM/Ollama)<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant Milvus as Milvus<br/>19530/TCP
    participant GitHub as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Slack as Slack Webhook<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,Route: Flow 1: Standard Agent Chat Request
    Client->>Route: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    Route->>Auth: Forward (TLS terminated)<br/>HTTP/8080
    Auth->>Auth: TokenReview via K8s API<br/>(if AUTH_ENABLED=true)
    Auth->>Agent: Authenticated request
    Agent->>LLM: POST /chat/completions<br/>API_KEY Bearer
    LLM-->>Agent: Completion response
    Agent-->>Route: SSE streaming response
    Route-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over Agent,MLflow: Flow 2: Agent with MLflow Tracing
    Agent->>MLflow: Log traces/spans<br/>Bearer token / SA token<br/>TLS (configurable verification)
    MLflow-->>Agent: Ack

    Note over Agent,PG: Flow 2b: DB Memory Agent
    Agent->>PG: Store/retrieve conversation<br/>Password auth
    PG-->>Agent: Memory context

    Note over Agent,Milvus: Flow 2c: Agentic RAG Agent
    Agent->>Milvus: Vector similarity search<br/>No auth (in-cluster)
    Milvus-->>Agent: Similar documents

    Note over Client,Slack: Flow 3: CI Failure Summarizer
    Client->>Route: POST /summarize<br/>HTTPS
    Route->>Agent: Forward
    Agent->>GitHub: GET workflow runs/logs<br/>GITHUB_TOKEN
    GitHub-->>Agent: CI failure data
    Agent->>PG: Group failures (SHA256 fingerprint)
    PG-->>Agent: Grouped failures
    Agent->>LLM: Summarize failures
    LLM-->>Agent: Summary
    Agent->>Slack: POST webhook<br/>Triage summary
    Agent-->>Client: Summary response
